## Description

In the Codex app, you can move chats in and out of projects, reference another chat with `@` or drag it into the text box, and ask one chat to message another on your behalf.  Including telling it that pineapple doesn’t belong on pizza. 🍍  @ChatGPT @OpenAIDevs https://t.co/dUiLxOSYfW

